1. Executive Summary

Prompt2Dashboard translates natural language into secure, ephemeral dashboards over live enterprise databases—no code, no static reports, no data left on the client.

The global Text2SQL market stands at $12 B in 2025, growing 35 % YoY. 83 % of enterprises report that data reporting does not meet business needs (Gartner). Yet every existing solution—Vanna, Dataherald, Tableau Pulse—sacrifices at least one of three non‑negotiables: true zero‑persistence UI, cryptographically sound audit trails, or absolute non‑technical operation.

Prompt2Dashboard is the first system to deliver all three simultaneously, built on four defensible pillars: runtime schema injection, AST‑based policy enforcement, ephemeral interfaces, and persistent, minimised audit logs. It serves the person whose question starts “Can I see…” but who cannot write SQL, wait for IT, or leave data behind.

Why now?

· GPT‑4o reaches 86 % on the academic Spider benchmark, making reliable Text2SQL possible.
· sqlglot provides zero‑dependency AST parsing for SQL guard enforcement across 20+ dialects.
· GDPR fines and healthcare breach costs (average $9.7 M) force organisations to demand zero‑retention analytics.

