7. Technical Stack (Justified)

7.1 Backend: Python + FastAPI

Async, OpenAPI‑native, perfect for AI integrations.

7.2 AI Pipeline: LangChain SQL Agent + Custom Confidence Scorer

· LangChain’s SQLDatabaseToolkit handles schema retrieval, query generation, and intermediate step tracking.
· Custom confidence scorer: after SQL generation, a separate LLM call evaluates intent‑mapping confidence on a 0‑100 scale. If <95, the pipeline aborts and asks for clarification.

7.3 Schema RAG (v2+)

For L3 (200+ columns): pgvector embeds table/column metadata, retrieves top‑K relevant elements per prompt. Grounded in GRAST‑SQL research showing 50 % prompt token reduction while maintaining >85 % accuracy on Spider‑2.0.

7.4 Database: PostgreSQL (prod), MySQL (optional), SQLite (dev)

Useful for on‑prem, air‑gapped deployments.

7.5 Frontend: React + Tailwind, stateless components

UI generated from JSON. Every dashboard includes a collapsible Explainability Panel: “Columns mapped: employee.name → ‘name’, employee.dept_code → ‘department’. Filter: status = ‘active’, hire_date > ‘2020‑12‑31’.”

7.6 Session & Audit: Redis (TTL) + PostgreSQL (encrypted audit table)

Redis ensures instant destruction; PostgreSQL stores minimised audit trails with AES‑256 encryption.

7.7 Security Utilities: sqlglot

AST parsing with zero external dependencies, 20+ dialects.

